---
kind: lore
id: codex
title: The Archive (codex pages)
series: frostCodex
---
/* The Archive tab. Each page answers codexOpen for its topic and teaches
it for good (learned is user tier). Pages unlock as the story reaches
them; the order below is the series order the Archive lists them in. */

<entry id="lanternSeaPage" on="codexOpen" target="topic.lanternSea" title="The Lantern Sea" when="visited('main.c3s8')">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Every wish the Hollow King swallowed and could not keep, he let go. They drift west, lit, forever.
  ::assert{learned(lanternSea)}
</entry>

<entry id="frostKingPage" on="codexOpen" target="topic.frostKing" title="The Frost King" when="holds('learned', ['lanternSea'])">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Before he was hollow he was the Frost King, and his first wish was for winter to stay. It did. He drowned the lantern himself.
  ::assert{learned(frostKing)}
</entry>

<entry id="nyxOathPage" on="codexOpen" target="topic.nyxOath" title="Nyx's Oath" when="holds('owned', ['nyx'])">
  @nyx{code="0010" emotion="shy"}: I swore to keep one candle lit for every wish nobody kept. It's a lot of candles.
  ::assert{learned(nyxOath)}
</entry>

<entry id="vigilPage" on="codexOpen" target="topic.vigil" title="The Frostlight Vigil">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Once a year the sea freezes for seven nights, and the lanterns can be reached on foot.
  @narrator{code="0020" when="@frostLive"}: The ice is thick tonight. {{@frostDaysLeft:plural(# night|# nights)}} of vigil left after this one.
</entry>
/* A page whose topic the story has not reached yet: the title, and nothing
else. The kind target renders the topic's label. */
<entry id="blankPage" on="codexOpen" target="kind:topic" title="(locked)" priority="-1">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: "{{occasion.target}}". The rest of the page is still blank.
</entry>
